## Article 327. Cassation court

```catala
declaration scope Article327CassationCourt:
  input determination content CassationCourtDetermination
  output supremeCourtIsCassationCourt content YesNo

scope Article327CassationCourt:
# Supreme Court is the cassation court
  label supreme_court definition supremeCourtIsCassationCourt under condition
    determination.isSupremeCourt = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label not_supreme definition supremeCourtIsCassationCourt equals No
```

## Article 328. Right to cassation appeal

```catala
declaration scope Article328CassationRight:
  input check content CassationRightCheck
  output hasRightToCassationAppeal content YesNo
  output mayAppealAppealCourtRuling content YesNo
  output notSubjectToCassation content YesNo
  output nonParticipantAcquiresRights content YesNo

scope Article328CassationRight:
# Case participants may appeal after appeal review
  label participant_appeal definition hasRightToCassationAppeal under condition
    check.isCaseParticipant = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

# Non-participant whose rights were decided may appeal
  label nonparticipant_appeal definition hasRightToCassationAppeal under condition
    check.courtDecidedRightsOfNonParticipant = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label no_right definition hasRightToCassationAppeal equals No

# May appeal appeal court rulings
  label appeal_ruling definition mayAppealAppealCourtRuling under condition
    check.appealingAppealCourtRuling = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label no_appeal_ruling definition mayAppealAppealCourtRuling equals No

# Not subject to cassation: Supreme Court appeal decisions, simplified proceedings
  label not_cassationable definition notSubjectToCassation under condition
    check.isNonAppealableCategory = Yes
    and check.simplifiedCassationExceptionApplies = No
    consequence equals Yes

  label exception_applies definition notSubjectToCassation under condition
    check.isNonAppealableCategory = Yes
    and check.simplifiedCassationExceptionApplies = Yes
    consequence equals No

  label cassationable definition notSubjectToCassation equals No

# Non-participant whose rights decided acquires participant rights
  label acquires_rights definition nonParticipantAcquiresRights under condition
    check.courtDecidedRightsOfNonParticipant = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label no_acquisition definition nonParticipantAcquiresRights equals No
```

## Article 329. Cassation appeal deadlines

```catala
declaration scope Article329CassationDeadlines:
  input deadline content CassationDeadlineDetermination
  output appealWithinDeadline content YesNo
  output deadlineMayBeRestored content YesNo
  output oneYearAbsoluteDeadlineApplies content YesNo

scope Article329CassationDeadlines:
# 30 days from pronouncement
  label thirty_days definition appealWithinDeadline under condition
    deadline.daysSincePronouncement <= 30
    consequence equals Yes

# Abbreviated: from full decision composition
  label abbreviated definition appealWithinDeadline under condition
    deadline.abbreviatedDecisionPronounced = Yes
    and deadline.daysSinceFullDecisionComposed <= 30
    consequence equals Yes

# Written: from full decision composition
  label written definition appealWithinDeadline under condition
    deadline.writtenProceeding = Yes
    and deadline.daysSinceFullDecisionComposed <= 30
    consequence equals Yes

  label deadline_expired definition appealWithinDeadline equals No

# Restoration when full decision not served on day of pronouncement
  label restoration_service definition deadlineMayBeRestored under condition
    deadline.fullDecisionServedToComplainant = No
    consequence equals Yes

# Restoration for good cause
  label restoration_good_cause definition deadlineMayBeRestored under condition
    deadline.goodCauseForDelay = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label no_restoration definition deadlineMayBeRestored equals No

# One year absolute deadline for prosecutor/authority
  label one_year definition oneYearAbsoluteDeadlineApplies under condition
    deadline.isProsecutorOrAuthority = Yes
    and deadline.oneYearSinceFullDecision = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label no_one_year definition oneYearAbsoluteDeadlineApplies under condition
    deadline.isProsecutorOrAuthority = Yes
    and deadline.oneYearSinceFullDecision = No
    consequence equals No
```

## Article 330. Form and content of cassation complaint

```catala
declaration scope Article330CassationForm:
  input check content CassationComplianceCheck
  output complaintMeetsFormRequirements content YesNo

scope Article330CassationForm:
# Complaint must meet all formal requirements
  label compliant definition complaintMeetsFormRequirements under condition
    check.complaintInWrittenForm = Yes
    and check.courtFeePaid = Yes
    and check.groundsSpecified = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label not_compliant definition complaintMeetsFormRequirements under condition
    check.complaintInWrittenForm = No
    consequence equals No

  label no_fee definition complaintMeetsFormRequirements under condition
    check.courtFeePaid = No
    and check.exemptFromCourtFee = No
    consequence equals No

  label no_grounds definition complaintMeetsFormRequirements under condition
    check.groundsSpecified = No
    consequence equals No
```

## Article 331. Filing procedure

```catala
declaration scope Article331CassationFiling:
  output filedDirectlyWithCassationCourt content YesNo

scope Article331CassationFiling:
# Cassation complaint filed directly with cassation court
  label direct_filing definition filedDirectlyWithCassationCourt equals Yes
```
